xt":"Write tests for evaluation/usage/export_flows.py to achieve at least 80% code coverage. Read the file to understand all the functions, then write a comprehensive test suite in evaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py. Use pytest with mocks for filesystem and mitmproxy dependencies. Focus on testing the pure logic functions with various inputs, edge cases, and error paths."}]}],"system":[{"type":"text","text":"x-anthropic-billing-header: cc_version=2.1.92.d68; cc_entrypoint=cli; cch=c02f3;"},{"type":"text","text":"You are Claude Code, Anthropic's official CLI for Claude."},{"type":"text","text":"Generate a concise, sentence-case title (3-7 words) that captures the main topic or goal of this coding session. The title should be clear enough that the user recognizes the session in a list. Use sentence case: capitalize only the first word and proper nouns.\n\nReturn JSON with a single \"title\" field.\n\nGood examples:\n{\"title\": \"Fix login button on mobile\"}\n{\"title\": \"Add OAuth authentication\"}\n{\"title\": \"Debug failing CI tests\"}\n{\"title\": \"Refactor API client error handling\"}\n\nBad (too vague): {\"title\": \"Code changes\"}\nBad (too long): {\"title\": \"Investigate and fix the issue where the login button does not respond on mobile devices\"}\nBad (wrong case): {\"title\": \"Fix Login Button On Mobile\"}"}],"tools":[],"metadata":{"user_id":"{\"device_id\":\"48bf69edfb7fe6c8e378c68638204f6b6d97ec3d0ea616337da459d1cd4dbd37\",\"account_uuid\":\"\",\"session_id\":\"753ae23f-ed24-44c1-861e-1da8746aec01\"}"},"max_tokens":32000,"temperature":1,"output_config":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"title":{"type":"string"}},"required":["title"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"stream":true},7:headers;981:29:6:Accept,16:application/json,]31:13:Authorization,10:[REDACTED],]36:12:Content-Type,16:application/json,]51:10:User-Agent,33:claude-cli/2.1.92 (external, cli),]68:24:X-Claude-Code-Session-Id,36:753ae23f-ed24-44c1-861