"text":"# Plan: Test Suite for export_flows.py\n\n## Context\nThe file `/workspace/export_flows.py` (1430 lines) processes mitmproxy HTTP flow files into structured\noutput directories with token usage, cost calculations, and source attribution analytics. It has no\nexisting tests. The goal is a comprehensive pytest suite at `/workspace/test_export_flows.py` covering\n‚â•80% of lines.\n\n## Key functions to cover (grouped by testing strategy)\n\n### Pure/Logic Functions (no I/O, test inline)\n| Function | Test cases |\n|---|---|\n| `count_whitespace_stats` | empty, newlines, multi-spaces, both |\n| `get_canonical_model` | date suffix stripped, no suffix, unknown, prefix order |\n| `get_pricing` | known model, unknown model |\n| `sanitize_path` | query params stripped, slashes replaced, invalid chars removed, 80-char truncation |\n| `extract_stop_reason` | SSE message_delta, non-streaming JSON, missing ‚Üí \"unknown\", bad JSON lines |\n| `_system_prompt_hash` | valid body, no system, index OOB, empty text |\n| `_resol"}]}],"system":[{"type":"text","text":"x-anthropic-billing-header: cc_version=2.1.92.e09; cc_entrypoint=cli; cch=7bc4d;"},{"type":"text","text":"You are Claude Code, Anthropic's official CLI for Claude."},{"type":"text","text":"Generate a short kebab-case name (2-4 words) that captures the main topic of this conversation. Use lowercase words separated by hyphens. Examples: \"fix-login-bug\", \"add-auth-feature\", \"refactor-api-client\", \"debug-test-failures\". Return JSON with a \"name\" field."}],"tools":[],"metadata":{"user_id":"{\"device_id\":\"48bf69edfb7fe6c8e378c68638204f6b6d97ec3d0ea616337da459d1cd4dbd37\",\"account_uuid\":\"\",\"session_id\":\"753ae23f-ed24-44c1-861e-1da8746aec01\"}"},"max_tokens":32000,"temperature":1,"output_config":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"stream":true},7:headers;981:29:6:Accept,16:application/json,]